    "title": "dim G(\u03bb) = Algebraic Multiplicity",
    "drawingSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 240 145\" class=\"w-full h-full\"><defs><marker id=\"arr-20804\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#000000\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"14\" y=\"14\" width=\"100\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"64.0\" y=\"34.0\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">dim G(\u03bb,T)</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"36\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">=</text><rect x=\"142\" y=\"14\" width=\"84\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"184.0\" y=\"34.0\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">mult of \u03bb in p_T</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\u03a3\u2c7c dim G(\u03bb\u2c7c) = dim V</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\u03a3\u2c7c (alg multiplicity) = n</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">also  dim E(\u03bb) \u2264 dim G(\u03bb)</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">equal for every \u03bb \u21d4 diagonalizable</text></svg>",
    "drawingCaption": "The size of the generalized eigenspace is the root multiplicity in the characteristic polynomial",
    "coreTranslation": [
      "<strong>Theorem:</strong> $\\dim G(\\lambda,T)$ equals the <strong>multiplicity of $\\lambda$ as a root of the characteristic polynomial</strong>.",
      "<strong>Consistency:</strong> since $V=\\bigoplus G(\\lambda_j)$, the algebraic multiplicities sum to $n=\\dim V$, matching the degree of $p_T$.",
      "<strong>Diagonalizability test:</strong> $E(\\lambda)\\subseteq G(\\lambda)$ always; $T$ is diagonalizable iff $E(\\lambda)=G(\\lambda)$ for every $\\lambda$ (geometric = algebraic)."
    ],
    "math": "$$\\dim G(\\lambda,T)=\\operatorname{mult}_{p_T}(\\lambda),\\qquad \\sum_j\\dim G(\\lambda_j,T)=\\dim V$$",
